<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00384">
	<title>Preparing software update</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02700">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02701">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" height="1.575in" href="../../images/N_CT25Z003_E.eps" placement="break" width="2.244in" id="e02702"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e02703">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Update Now</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Cancel Update</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>If you press the <uicontrol>Update Now</uicontrol> button on the screen, the vehicle will begin installing the update automatically. The following conditions must be satisfied:</p>
		<ul id="e02704">
			<li>
				<p>The vehicle must be off.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The gear must be in P (Park).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The Electronic Parking Brake (EPB) must be applied.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The exterior lights must be turned off.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The hood must be closed.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The battery must be sufficiently charged.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The systems to be updated must not be running.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<ul id="e02705">
			<li>
				<p>To update immediately, press <uicontrol>Update Now</uicontrol> (1).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To cancel the update, press <uicontrol>Cancel Update</uicontrol> (2).</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="tip" id="e02706">
			<p>The battery and system status are automatically checked by the vehicle.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>